The '''Mountain Clan village''' was a series of cave dwellings established by the [[Mountain Clan]] in the [[mountain]]s of the [[planet]] [[Dathomir]]. The village was led by a [[Mountain Clan Matron|Matron]].<ref name="The Path of Fear" /> In [[20 BBY]],<ref name="Date">{{TalesDate|E1}}</ref> the [[Nightsister]] [[witch]] [[Morgan Elsbeth]] was rescued by the Mountain Clan after the [[Battle of Dathomir|massacre]] of the Nightsisters. Elsbeth later awoke in one of the village's cave dwellings in the care of the Mountain Clan Matron. The Matron led Elsbeth outside where she looked across the planet from the safety of the mountain and saw the [[Fire|scorched]] land around the [[Nightsister lair]]. The Matron told Elsbeth she was safe from the [[Confederacy of Independent Systems|Separatists's]] [[battle droids|droids]] in the protection of the Mountain Clan and their village.<ref name="The Path of Fear" />

[[Supreme Martial Commander of the Separatist Droid Armies|General]] [[Grievous]]
deployed patrols of [[HMP droid gunship]]s and [[Ringneck recon droid|probe droids]] to root out and [[Death|kill]] any surviving Nightsisters who survived the Separatist invasion. The Matron instructed Elsbeth, as well as her daughter [[Nali]] to stay in the safety of the village and warned them not to fight back.<ref name="The Path of Fear" />

